 "about": "Home as an empty plate plus furniture layers, cut from art/scenery/home/background.png (2026-09-13, art/prototypes/home-layers/). A prototype, not served. Painting px throughout. Draw the plate, then every shadow, then the layers and Lumi in depth order (`depth`). Built by plate.py from room.src.json.",
